# ThesisRadar domains

| Surface | Primary URL | Platform |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Web (primary)** | `https://thesis-radar.intelliforge.tech` | Vercel |
| API | `https://thesis-radar-api.fly.dev` | Fly.io (`thesis-radar-api`) |
| Brand | Separate from vettd-app.com | IntelliForge |

## Rules

- Use `thesis-radar.intelliforge.tech` in user-facing links, CORS, Clerk allowed origins, and email templates — not `*.vercel.app` as primary.
- Keep `https://*.vercel.app` only as preview/CORS fallback.
- `SIGNAL_ENGINE_API_URL` on Vercel production → `https://thesis-radar-api.fly.dev`
- AgentMail digest inbox lives on `intelliforge.tech` (e.g. `alerts@intelliforge.tech`).
